sible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Barranquilla, manzana por manzana","size":24.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":3,"name":"Text","x":10.0,"y":19.0,"w":190.0,"h":7.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"4 de cada 10 manzanas son estrato 1; solo 3 de cada 100 son estrato 5 o 6","size":11.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":4,"name":"Rectangle","x":184.5,"y":30.0,"w":14.0,"h":17.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,204],"outline":[34,34,34,255],"width":1.0,"radius":1.0}}},{"id":5,"name":"North Arrow","x":186.0,"y":31.0,"w":11.0,"h":15.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"NorthArrow":{"frame":1,"style":"Compass","fill":[34,34,34,255],"outline":[34,34,34,255]}}},{"id":6,"name":"Rectangle","x":11.0,"y":218.5,"w":32.0,"h":9.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,204],"outline":[34,34,34,255],"width":1.0,"radius":1.0}}},{"id":7,"name":"Scale Bar","x":13.0,"y":220.0,"w":30.0,"h":6.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"ScaleBar":{"frame":1,"units":"Kilometers","divisions":2,"style":"Line"}}},{"id":8,"name":"Legend","x":10.0,"y":232.0,"w":58.0,"h":50.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Legend":{"frame":1,"title":"Estrato predominante","all_classes":false,"hide_other":false,"exclude":["Barranquilla"]}}},{"id":9,"name":"Text","x":72.0,"y":232.0,"w":128.0,"h":21.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Cómo se hizo: todo en RustGIS web (web.rustgis.app), con tres scripts.\n1 · Datos: el estrato predominante por manzana en 5 consultas PBF de 2000 manzanas y el límite\n     municipal del IGAC, sobre el mapa base oscuro Mi Ciudad de la Alcaldía, con su estilo oficial.\n2 · Vista: Merge de las 5 consultas, Simplify a 1 m (el proyecto baja de 22 a ~3 MB) y Unique\n     Values por ESTRATO_PREDOMINANTE_INT: un color (magma) y una etiqueta por estrato.\n3 · Layout: armado por script. Los scripts: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":7.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":10,"name":"Text","x":72.0,"y":255.0,"w":128.0,"h":13.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Datos: Estrato predominante por manzana 2018 — DANE, Equipo de Esri Colombia (CNPV 2018;\nreferencial, no oficial). Límite municipal: IGAC. Consultado el 2026-11-03.\nMapa base: Mi Ciudad (oscuro), Alcaldía de Barranquilla.","size":7.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":11,"name":"Text","x":10.0,"y":284.0,"w":190.0,"h":6.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"#30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Día 3: Polygons · Hecho con RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":8.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":12},{"name":"Day 03","width":210.0,"height":297.0,"elements":[{"id":1,"name":"Map Frame","x":10.0,"y":28.0,"w":190.0,"h":200.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Map","center":{"x":-74.83164279049998,"y":10.98875160863989},"scale":92527.64683180409,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":null}}},{"id":2,"name":"Text","x":10.0,"y":8.0,"w":190.0,"h":12.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Barranquilla, block by block","size":24.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":3,"name":"Text","x":10.0,"y":19.0,"w":190.0,"h":7.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"On Colombia's 1–6 socioeconomic scale, 4 in 10 blocks are stratum 1; only 3 in 100 are 5 or 6","size":11.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":4,"name":"Rectangle","x":184.5,"y":30.0,"w":14.0,"h":17.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,204],"outline":[34,34,34,255],"width":1.0,"radius":1.0}}},{"id":5,"name":"North Arrow","x":186.0,"y":31.0,"w":11.0,"h":15.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"NorthArrow":{"frame":1,"style":"Compass","fill":[34,34,34,255],"outline":[34,34,34,255]}}},{"id":6,"name":"Rectangle","x":11.0,"y":218.5,"w":32.0,"h":9.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,204],"outline":[34,34,34,255],"width":1.0,"radius":1.0}}},{"id":7,"name":"Scale Bar","x":13.0,"y":220.0,"w":30.0,"h":6.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"ScaleBar":{"frame":1,"units":"Kilometers","divisions":2,"style":"Line"}}},{"id":8,"name":"Legend","x":10.0,"y":232.0,"w":58.0,"h":50.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Legend":{"frame":1,"title":"Predominant stratum","all_classes":false,"hide_other":false,"exclude":["Barranquilla"]}}},{"id":9,"name":"Text","x":72.0,"y":232.0,"w":128.0,"h":21.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"How it was made: all in RustGIS web (web.rustgis.app), with four scripts.\n1 · Data: the predominant stratum per block in 5 PBF queries of 2,000 blocks and the IGAC\n     municipal boundary, on the Alcaldía's dark Mi Ciudad basemap, with its official style.\n2 · View: Merge of the 5 queries, Simplify to 1 m (7 times fewer vertices) and Unique Values\n     by ESTRATO_PREDOMINANTE_INT: one colour (magma) and one label per stratum.\n3–4 · Layouts in Spanish and English, by script: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":7.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":10,"name":"Text","x":72.0,"y":255.0,"w":128.0,"h":13.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Data: Predominant stratum per block 2018 — DANE, Esri Colombia team (CNPV 2018;\nreference only, not official). Municipal boundary: IGAC. Accessed 2026-11-03.\nBasemap: Mi Ciudad (dark), Alcaldía de Barranquilla.","size":7.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":11,"name":"Text","x":10.0,"y":284.0,"w":190.0,"h":6.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"#30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Day 3: Polygons · Made with RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":8.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":12}],"folders":[],"styles":[],"ramps":[],"tasks":[],"gp_env":{"extent":null,"cell_size":null},"models":[],"workspaces":[],"link_views":false,"jobs":[],"offline_areas":[],"reports":[],"presentations":[],"notebooks":[],"dl_models":[],"shared":[],"data_stores":[]}